# Keep Docker build contexts small and reproducible: excludes build output, VCS metadata, IDE
# state, and anything that would let a stale local build leak into the image (see the
# stale-target/-bytecode bug documented in agent-framework.md).
**/target/
**/*.class

.git/
.github/
.gitignore

.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.log

**/*.md

.dockerignore
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
